VirtualGroupSampler restores the repository's earlier group-level adaptation
of Meta's repeat-before-rank-split RASampler:
https://github.com/facebookresearch/deit/blob/main/samplers.py
Indexed local tar access is imported from the BSD-3-Clause WebDataset WIDS
package (https://github.com/webdataset/wids); its reader is not vendored.
Fused LAMB is imported from NVIDIA Apex (BSD-3-Clause), not vendored.
The accumulated CUDA Graph prewarm follows the synchronized-first-backward
workaround documented in https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/143580.

